g.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"今、装填してるのは…怒り。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/IVWbxvv71ETjlsFXeScIh2Uw8vIrAodP.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"それなりに、大変なことになるかも？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/bfDkBEJX8KxHKxOlRluFTz80KZYU45lf.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"それなりに、大変なことになるかも？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/pqbXDwas9p5qgcJcW1tBPSxvxpBZGkuI.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"先生の敵は、許さない。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/dy2FPErIP1dBpZnuHZ8HL8jtLAZigIM9.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":" \t もっとたくさんの物が作りたい。そうして……もっと先生の力になりたい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/ueipJ6NPPTsxZFz10eeAX1KDKrTvrysM.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Formation_In_1","category":"formation","text":"私が……行く……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/zNHAqhN2JeKzr8n3RqJ3LfPTaLy8QUeY.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Formation_In_2","category":"formation","text":"少し、嬉しいかも。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/vSjPwhqJ3CX0wUj6U9lwpLK71g1l82zh.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"今頃だと予測して、待ってた。先生が私の名前を呼んでくれる…今この瞬間を。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/UV8KIEOSvfPZ4ckysT4m0MwXceHcHaWH.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"今頃だと予測して、待ってた。先生が私の名前を呼んでくれる…今この瞬間を。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/q2u3cY4nL5zp8n4ySX1KlpjxiKsZrbci.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"要約すると…私、強くなった。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/vUtoQDWpWZDpHUhAEtJEiFFsQIchmlgE.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"先生と一緒なら、意欲が湧く。うん、もっとたくさん教えて。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/eApeuB5tE9gXuQpjRLDMyFSBu4g2iqYS.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"戦闘が好きなわけではないけど、私も先生の力になりたい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/YIolZOOQqfsrcpPsYqJMVtpRTg9jTFcm.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"こうやって先生と一緒にいると…ふふ…楽しい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/dtnXPUWiQQ8uJP5CjB1MEp6xt55v65Ul.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"\t 先生、どう？私の装備たち…役に立ったかな？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/idXBCXBFAZVaoiG51FPL0vmEjZZZ9X0f.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"有用な物を作ることが楽しいかって？それもあるけど… これは趣味じゃなく、生き様だよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/xAb1LQhd4Aa9HBLJVrGH8F3tFhNchVkx.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"\t 整備は好き。死んでいた機械の心臓がまた動き出す時の、何かが叶えられたっていう、その感覚を愛してる。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/8c32IrMIxqvi1PVQpArQQ22riRg5C9bf.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"（先生のその笑顔が…私にとっては最高のモチベーションなの）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/gMWBUAxc76LyotLet1ZVbTIGtpT9GrlR.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"\t おはよう先生。今日の任務リストを机に置いておいたの。確認してほしい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/VxlhwvORCje4PcDJAST1v3jJkIEyuHtN.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"ん…今の先生の任務進行は多少、非効率的な状態だと思う。 もっといいやり方を探してみる。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/AcmHYwE0nOGOGHBWxDvkm3LwSw19xm1j.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"ありがとう、先生。この風景は先生のおかげで叶えてるの。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/boy99CSo8jGG2HV17j7ANQ2Y2y7I5esa.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"美しいでしょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/iWkwRA9CYEXhLhkmqyNWLoSCpnH0kOVx.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"間に合ってよかった。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/zS5mDlH6mDSplH6yagWXDtLh9gzUqRqU.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"うん？どうして？そんなに頑張ったのたっけ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/yQIFOLfMhKZwdFr9uts2ljdpcDM8XnrM.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"ミレニアムの生徒たちは安全に","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/5k7Xygo619hdIXvGwR0VlQYqslZDZIPj.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"輝く夜道が歩けるようにしてあげたっかたから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/fVN5S8DO9V32Ic8iP7jb5gvq8vwiRAVs.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"私にできることは、これぐらいしかないから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/OOjhfAKtH9OYQXZq6B1kWqT92pMgEXuz.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"そして、私にとって、","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/jilVn6FCyfP4JTXi78rlM0wTUQItSi8n.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"こういう瞬間はすでにプレゼント以上の素敵なものなの。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/ClvsqsClP774Xu9ZN6Y4FYk918SYAdYV.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"どう？先生。まだ時間はあるから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/BojjWlHfaKyHlu2EGtWhV7ky24GrrSaW.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"もう少し一緒にいってくれる？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/UJyGQnRxXq4hkzVn4I58Xmq1ukvADbrZ.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"もし今、私の先生に対する心を検査したら、きっと、陽性だと思う。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/pNHhld1vREI3Borjmt4aUsCKX3ctWXuO.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"\t これからの私はどこでなにをするんだろう。誰もわからないと思うけど、私はわかってる。先生と、一緒に行く。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/qcoE3aseplBZVU2G7t9ZDLvgyh6gWLdR.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"\t 不思議だね。記憶機能に問題でもあるのかな？言いたいことがたくさんあったのに、先生の顔を見ると思い出せなくなるの……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/CuICku9Fpw4kn53YGQ8bFR185khavRFJ.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"運命なんて信じてない。でも、先生に出会ったその瞬間から…運命に感謝するようになったの。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/EMge7zmYtgqn4ZApp8sHyc5t4iwrneRU.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"プレゼントで欲しいもの？ない …もう、たくさんもらってるから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/CPNighvn1FgHfOtTborD7mK6dMCKv5Dj.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Season_Birthday_Player","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとう先生。先生が生まれて、そして私たちのところに来てくれて。…嬉しい。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/SqpVFIiC2mGz0f701gbXrEGZtoDDjVNl.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Season_Halloween","category":"lobby","text":"ハロウィーンデーか…非科学的な日だけど、なんだかときめく、不思議な日だね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/AmSdewjxScMpzlkXOXxoFsWswCzPfLYg.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"明けましておめでとう。今年はより改善されて、向上した私を見せてあげるね…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/kEP0HksCdhe8QYVSQxmDEZyVgw5KRMIP.ogg"},{"description":"Hibiki_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"サンタクロースさんがたった一晩でキヴォトスの子供たちにプレゼントを渡すためには…彼のトナカイは最低マッハ4以上の速度を出さなきゃいけないはず。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/yoXUevoAaqDaqmzdNUMace4HDUr9I0is.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"hibiki_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"所有变量均已计算完毕。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/xwULhjVjcuoIcQJ0ajUqRcVHiqWobwKa.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"小心，可能会有伏击。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/vhAhO7gRYoqgadzPHm45hknmQncpRmyT.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_battle_tsa_1","category":"battle","text":"虽然我不是开车的专家，但我是机械的专家。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/LWuu1PtMoxKOxEAuJD85EqPvyQBbUzif.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_battle_tsa_2","category":"battle","text":"这就是，千禧年的品质。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/vzWhdwbpd6Gvgd9OfFGOfIkibSn6Hacv.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"嗯，我发现有些内部项目有可以修理和改善的地方。欸？不能修理吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/Lo312mFZEX8lKGrtNu2eYEKqlp14g8tD.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_cafe_act_2","category":"cafe","text":"需要的话，我可以给你装一个陷阱，让过来的人都吓一跳。嗯？不可以啊......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/TZsJTil0EievqXb8i515oJqUiLgMYlR7.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"”要是再给我一点时间和预算的话......“哼，那只是给自己的能力不足找借口罢了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/Ff89Z7gTuB2pwCIsc2htLzbeE6liTn3A.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"在有限的时间和预算内得到最好的结果，这才是真正的大师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/FpZZ7idU3U3a4yCgRCT0yGGnPpHM9Rtd.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"在这里给老师建一个铜像怎么样？我可以让铜像的手脚关节都动起来哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/v9hxeNtpzvoqp7ReDCoQYIYOF0H63xD0.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"支援射击，开始。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/IX9KCI0Xm3vJ4T9BAtJzT02iZmYschiZ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"确认敌人的位置，准备开火。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/0KVyfvEZpUzVaIrfzdgWxxXnNjTRIQZz.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"力量正在高涨，上吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/ml8Q5smgpOyMH6yVbm8GFflVvGpv9wjx.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"把我的愤怒化作炮弹。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/JItUwaw4lGMak9yKeGCYYEVIdWSN00J0.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"可能会，有点难熬。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/4MgwrURynLwEl51UivAlGNOLElqCpVMT.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"直接命中目标，成功。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/byjxUphYOvRlTR3Mm4WVs0czu4pY7odG.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"老师的敌人，不可原谅。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/YOFSMFQGpN5yj8GJzSkveNPcmzQzPvBe.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"我还想制造出更多的东西，这样我就可以给老师帮更多的忙了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/61FtVyrlovMF1e0VOuCjiZYnMUdEs2YB.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"我，会去的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/u4JUbLIqwOtUzZnUcVFQp83K9vdvur1s.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"感觉，有点高兴。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/kK7CBFErEsm3voJssKnlebPJFIhTGrou.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我预测到了时刻将近，所以一直在等待。等着老师您刚才叫我名字的，这个瞬间。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/8DEYxE8glXj6VfjDK7RSvGt4noO6TB52.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"完美是不存在的，只存在追求完美的过程。对所有的大师来说都是如此。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/XfAgF2a1JYIZ5Ezrg2XRx1EFxMM3ifBp.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"总而言之，我变强了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/08KmYOLd7wbe2kE7Dl4lz78qa1b6q0Ui.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"和老师在一起，会很受鼓舞。我想知道，想知道的事情还有很多。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/nqQVLSLGcoh2fGPWU6qTDWHr3wmu0DYZ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我并不喜欢战斗，但是，我也想助老师一臂之力。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/ez3ukv2bEBuQjeUDK0aO7ugwLTHYdgQ3.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"和老师这么呆在一起......嘿嘿......挺开心的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/J8EIlS92EKevz65PQEpRDyT2arzZjyZu.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，怎么样？我的那些准备，派上用场了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/TIrwI163MLqPYRo9IvFKskqKRnWgpiwJ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"你问我做这些实用的东西开不开心？开心当然是开心的。不过与其说这是我的兴趣，不如说这就是我的生活方式吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/QWDp5ktpK0MBkIj9IQMLaxIrTG00YLeq.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"我喜欢整备。让那些死掉的机器的心脏重新跳起来的时候，我会有一种强烈的满足感。我爱那种感觉。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/JNMec7DPZAVAQHaARM7PbN23g9h7AhQX.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"老师的笑容，对我来说是最强的动力。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/8vjjS0Tsb39vdC5IlDSIr1QyXuHBjB9a.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"早上好啊，老师。今天的任务列表我放桌子上了，希望你能确认一下。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/w51G9kVOTAuk3qpiKTqCOf72fXVYAAwh.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，我觉得老师现在执行任务的效率不是太高。我看看能不能帮你找个更好的办法。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/DZb1TXFzizbqQ5dbKI9tiy4rWSVxj9if.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢你，老师。多亏了你，这里的景色才能变成现实。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/xpLxqHZiLJ3Dl1dyGCnj6a9iSaqZE88u.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"很美，是吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/VzkIeFWFfQHzUpm5RJGBe55XeDLQgsRo.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_1_3","category":"lobby","text":"还好按时完成了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/rx7d6Oi2vc3EQY4L5s0BHkcSqvgBheeZ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？你问我为什么要这么努力？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/VGctuUWSAIbFFlrut8oMtj0uzbI7Jsjx.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"我想保证千禧年大家的安全。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/1xbmcFVT9fva4OcOGwpIpPlkmRkS1yoR.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"想让她们即使是夜里，也能走在明亮的道路上。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/BCzgJgU7PbIDZ12of76ppfuOPBBhtZai.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"我能做到的事情也就只有这些而已了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/qbMIqWDIhT0PLOMMe4yzA4CcbrhcFJPO.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"而且，对我来说......","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/uZWnOhWyIN1ue2vLZwTbbC6Z04CX9Ceh.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"这一刻的意义，已经变成了比礼物更美好的东西。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/NaKLm0NfKAPrlvz7YLUz5iQfvK0V166w.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"怎么样，老师？现在还有一点时间。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/eZDf4WQnKKfTVC73waGsmhjKDfZ5GDJJ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"你愿意再多陪我一会吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/x9tAC3CKVyAXJeG08jHDvmvWLe9DfW4z.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"如果现在检测一下我对老师的感情，结果一定是积极的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/mUHHRa0MVSTHqNqtp46B5lSXBxUYRzUM.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"今后我会在哪里，又会做些什么呢？大概没有人会知道吧。但是我知道，我会一直陪伴在老师身边。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/J5HZEfUntr1ONsIzqmVA9Pw8o9HnlNvJ.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"真是不可思议啊。是不是我的记忆功能出问题了？明明有很多话想说，但是看到老师的脸，就一句都想不起来了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/B11beGvgfR0pc2QETQhSmV1fPmM7xMIU.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"我不相信命运这种东西。但是从遇见老师的那个瞬间起，我就开始感谢命运了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/Au0plfF7wYrkal7BjowCZifU92uRI0GA.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"有什么想要的礼物？没有。因为我已经得到很多了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/pmcOOwHH060z5uFeEIgBtZ19vCsMsz8h.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝老师生日快乐。老师诞生在这个世界上，然后来到我们身边......我很开心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/Usv6aLZWq1CDx9LNf58Xr7o9OOkrard4.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节啊......虽然这种日子很不科学，但是不知道为什么，感觉有点兴奋。太不可思议了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/e6TDnY3PMJ4ivpRvX0IEVuzd4JKrRnGS.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐。今年我会继续提升自己，努力进步，好好表现的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/RRcc8UALUJ1mOZIewRPANg6T0opcnmvs.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"如果圣诞老人想在一夜之间给基沃托斯的所有孩子都送去礼物的话，他的驯鹿速度应该至少要达到4马赫以上。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/dRZzHbkRjSJ7xIdLhgnPRl0uCN9LUH5m.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"新春快乐,今年我想制作出更多实用的装备,为了大家,也为了……老师。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%A1%9A%20%E5%93%8D/ge6RjEX7iR9tXilpFNqQq7clQ5PcRVQT.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"中秋快乐,千禧年的灯火总是很闪耀,可都比不上这轮明月放出的光辉,真是不可思议啊。 ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%A1%9A%20%E5%93%8D/jDDtceMG29Oq6BpO7cUdA3zNmHQ7yW24.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%A1%9A%20%E5%93%8D/QQbVGixI7Eluwe2pIUoWzA5CRG8bfMx1.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"hibiki_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/original/hibiki_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/original/hibiki_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/original/hibiki_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/original/hibiki_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%8C%AB%E5%86%A2%20%E5%93%8D/original/hibiki_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"hibiki_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"",